# TNSVT — Line endings and diff configuration
# Force LF for all text files; let git auto-detect binary.
# Works in combination with .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf) to prevent
# CRLF contamination on Windows where core.autocrlf=true by default.

*               text=auto eol=lf
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.pdf           binary
*.zip           binary
*.gz            binary
*.tar           binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
*.ttf           binary
*.eot           binary
